  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>Ресурсные топлива</strong></h1>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resource_Fuels/BH_Resource_Fuels_description.webp\"></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3>Resource Fuels — это простой мод, добавляющий новые источники топлива в систему плавки Minecraft</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>Включает уголь из железа, золота, алмазов, изумрудов и незерита, а также 3 новых типа угля, которые открывают новые ветки прогрессии ещё дальше&nbsp;</h3>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>ДРУГИЕ МОДПАКИ</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fractal-times\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fractal Times</a>&nbsp;- Egged Up -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/freedom-of-progression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freedom of Progression</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fop-airborne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freedom of Progression: Airborne</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/freedom-of-progression-an-adventure-awaits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freedom of Progression II</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/captive-survival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Captive Survival&nbsp;</a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/codename-exploratory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codename Exploratory</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/progressionistic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressionistic</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rewind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rewind</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/progressionisticcreations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Коллекция моих модов</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/christianbutnot/justanotherlibrarymod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1121892/description_61fb5249-8c8a-440d-ac15-e0a662e2ab67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"386\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsWATPgvzx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resource_Fuels/BH_Resource_Fuels_discord.webp\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fmc_pcreations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resource_Fuels/BH_Resource_Fuels_twitter.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fprogression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resource_Fuels/BH_Resource_Fuels_promo2.webp\"></a></p>",
